[
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "Resetting Ableton Live returns the application to its default state. Performing a reset of Live can help rule out any problematic custom settings or template files when troubleshooting.",
    "body_html_line": 1,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [],
    "id": "RESET-B001",
    "source_id": "HELP-RESET-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "Reset Live 11 and later: macOSReset Live 11 and later: WindowsLive 10 and earlier",
    "body_html_line": 2,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [],
    "id": "RESET-B002",
    "source_id": "HELP-RESET-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "Resetting Live clears the following and restores to default:",
    "body_html_line": 3,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [],
    "id": "RESET-B003",
    "source_id": "HELP-RESET-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "li",
    "text": "Live's Preferences, including Audio and MIDI settings",
    "body_html_line": 5,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [],
    "id": "RESET-B004",
    "source_id": "HELP-RESET-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "li",
    "text": "Template Set",
    "body_html_line": 6,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [],
    "id": "RESET-B005",
    "source_id": "HELP-RESET-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "li",
    "text": "Undo History",
    "body_html_line": 7,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [],
    "id": "RESET-B006",
    "source_id": "HELP-RESET-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "After a reset of Live, you'll need to re-enable your hardware devices and plug-in folders, re-enter custom input/output names, and re-select any custom settings in Live's Preferences.",
    "body_html_line": 9,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [],
    "id": "RESET-B007",
    "source_id": "HELP-RESET-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "Note: The instructions below specify certain files to move to the Desktop. After moving the files, test to see if resetting Live solves the issue. If the issue is indeed solved, you can then delete the files from your Desktop. If the issue is not solved, you can instead move the files back to their original locations to restore your custom settings.",
    "body_html_line": 10,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [],
    "id": "RESET-B008",
    "source_id": "HELP-RESET-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
