  {
    "kind": "li",
    "text": "In Finder, open this hidden folder (where x.x.x is the installed version of Live, eg. 10.1.30): :Users/[username]/Library/Preferences/Ableton/Live x.x.xNote: Here's how to access hidden folders on Mac.",
